	note = {arXiv:2508.19075 [quant-ph]},
	annote = {Comment: The updated version adds new applications and discussions on information scrambling with globally controlled analog quantum systems. 11 pages, 6 figures with Methods. HYH, AMG, and LC contributed equally to this work. Updated acknowledgement and references},
