	annote = {ContentsIntroductionA Local 2D Lattice ArchitectureReview of Definitions and Analysis Method for the [[7,1,3]] CodeLocal Fault-tolerant CircuitryLocal Steane Error Correction (1-EC)Local Preparations (1-Preps)Local Rectangles and Their Use of Space and TimeMethodologyCalculation of Failure ProbabilitiesThreshold StudiesClifford-group Location ThresholdsApproximate Closed Form for Thresholdsa-preparation Threshold and Injection by TeleportationConcluding Remarks on the Noise Threshold of the [[7,1,3]] Code},
